    <body stage="SubtitleEdit">
        <part updateMethod="0" lastModifyTime="0">
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:03,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:05,684</end-time>
                <translation>镰仓时代的僧人
鎌倉時代の僧侶</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="2" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:05,684</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:11,075</end-time>
                <translation>记录亲鸾教义的佛教书籍《叹异抄》
親鸞の教えを記した仏教書歎異抄</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="3" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:11,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:15,850</end-time>
                <translation>亲鸾死后错误理解其教义的人越来越多</translation>
                <original>親鸞の死後その教えとは異なる考えを語る者が増え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="4" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:15,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:18,465</end-time>
                <translation>于是弟子唯圆提笔著书</translation>
                <original>弟子の唯円は筆を取りました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="5" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:21,915</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:25,000</end-time>
                <translation>然而其中的逻辑非常复杂</translation>
                <original>しかしその論理はとっても複雑</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="6" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:25,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:26,620</end-time>
                <translation>并非轻易就能理解</translation>
                <original>一筋縄ではいきません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="7" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:28,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:32,945</end-time>
                <translation>亲鸾的话语会使人们在迷茫与救赎的夹缝间</translation>
                <original>親鸞の言葉によって人々は迷いと救いの狭間で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="8" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:32,945</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:35,250</end-time>
                <translation>被悬置在半空中</translation>
                <original>宙づりにさせられます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="9" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:37,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:40,686</end-time>
                <translation>正因为不痛快才有趣的《叹异抄》</translation>
                <original>すっきりしないから面白い歎異抄</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="10" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:40,686</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:43,260</end-time>
                <translation>让我们来品味这种朦胧不清的滋味</translation>
                <original>そのモヤモヤっぷりを味わいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="11" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:05,581</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:10,948</end-time>
                <translation>第3回 在迷茫与救赎之间
第3回　迷いと救いの間で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="12" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:12,068</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:14,340</end-time>
                <translation>《100分de名著》 主持人矶野祐子
100分で名著司会の磯野祐子です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="13" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:14,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:15,604</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="14" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:15,604</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:18,140</end-time>
                <translation>那么 本月我们在介绍的《叹异抄》
さあ今月ご紹介している歎異抄</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="15" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:18,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:21,602</end-time>
                <translation>上回讲到了恶人反而能获得救度</translation>
                <original>前回は悪人こそ救われるということでしたが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="16" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:21,602</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:23,101</end-time>
                <translation>到目前为止感觉如何</translation>
                <original>これまでいかがですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="17" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:23,101</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,165</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 总觉得当时好像明白了</translation>
                <original>そうですねなんかその時分かったと思って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="18" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:26,165</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:27,521</end-time>
                <translation>可一回到家</translation>
                <original>家に帰るんですけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="19" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:27,521</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:30,035</end-time>
                <translation>那这么想啊 对于努力行善的</translation>
                <original>じゃあなんか努力している</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="20" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:30,035</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:33,006</end-time>
                <translation>善人来说 会不会觉得不公平呢</translation>
                <original>善人の方からすると不公平だなみたいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="21" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:33,006</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,820</end-time>
                <translation>好像记住了一件事</translation>
                <original>なんか一つのことを覚えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="22" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:34,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:37,544</end-time>
                <translation>接着又冒出新的疑问</translation>
                <original>じゃあじゃあっていうのが出て</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="23" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:37,544</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:39,516</end-time>
                <translation>今天我想也会有不少动摇</translation>
                <original>今日もかなり揺れるとは思うんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="24" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:39,516</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,884</end-time>
                <translation>-是啊 会绕来绕去呢 -是的</translation>
                <original>-ええぐるぐるしちゃいますよね　-はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="25" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:41,884</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,960</end-time>
                <translation>今天是第3回</translation>
                <original>今日第3回ですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="26" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:43,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:45,633</end-time>
                <translation>我们要看哪些内容呢</translation>
                <original>どんなところを見ていきましょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="27" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:45,633</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:50,565</end-time>
                <translation>第1回和第2回我们读了《叹异抄》的前半部分
第1回第2回と歎異抄の前半部分を読んできましたが</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="28" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:50,565</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:53,722</end-time>
                <translation>从今天开始进入后半部分</translation>
                <original>今日から後半の部分になるんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="29" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:53,722</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:55,661</end-time>
                <translation>实际上后半部分
実は後半の部分が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="30" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:55,661</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,654</end-time>
                <translation>才是《叹异抄》原本的核心部分
本来の歎異抄の本体の部分</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="31" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:58,654</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:01,180</end-time>
                <translation>就是这一部分</translation>
                <original>こちらの部分になりますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="32" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:01,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:05,362</end-time>
                <translation>从第11章到第18章</translation>
                <original>第11章から第18章</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="33" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:05,362</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:07,440</end-time>
                <translation>像四字熟语一样的这些</translation>
                <original>四字熟語のようなこのような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="34" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:07,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,809</end-time>
                <translation>誓名别信、学解往生</translation>
                <original>誓名别信＜せいみょうべっしん＞学解往生＜がくげおうじょう＞</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="35" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:10,809</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:13,920</end-time>
                <translation>专修劝善等等都是四字</translation>
                <original>専修勧善＜せんじゅけんぜん＞などなどあるんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="36" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:13,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:16,160</end-time>
                <translation>内容都是唯元对于错误理解的批判</translation>
                <original>異義を書いてある内容なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="37" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:16,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:18,503</end-time>
                <translation>《叹异抄》本身并没有这些标题</translation>
                <original>歎異抄にこういうタイトルがついているわけじゃないんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="38" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:18,503</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,120</end-time>
                <translation>是后人给各条加上这样的四字熟语</translation>
                <original>後の人がこの各条にこういう四字熟語を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="39" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:22,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:23,751</end-time>
                <translation>来理解它的</translation>
                <original>当てはめて理解したんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="40" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:23,751</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,394</end-time>
                <translation>每一种都是错误的见解</translation>
                <original>それぞれどれも間違った見解</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="41" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:26,394</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,709</end-time>
                <translation>唯円呢 则逐一将它们摘出来</translation>
                <original>これを一つ一つ唯円という人は取り上げて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="42" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:29,709</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:32,156</end-time>
                <translation>加以批判</translation>
                <original>それに対する批判を加えているという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="43" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:32,156</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:34,326</end-time>
                <translation>用四字熟语来来总结 那到上一回为止</translation>
                <original>四字熟語でいうと前回までに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="44" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:34,326</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:37,325</end-time>
                <translation>我已经学到了“他力本愿”</translation>
                <original>あのたりき本願については教えてもらいましたから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="45" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:37,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:41,034</end-time>
                <translation>所以我觉得只要跟着释先生走总会有办法</translation>
                <original>釈先生についていけば何とかなるんだという形の僕は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="46" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:41,034</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:44,072</end-time>
                <translation>-我想用他力本愿来说服大家　-说得好</translation>
                <original>-他力本願で言い込んでいきたいと思っています　-うまい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="47" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:44,072</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:45,300</end-time>
                <translation>-请多关照　-请多关照</translation>
                <original>-よろしくお願いいたします　-お願いします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="48" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:45,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:50,307</end-time>
                <translation>那么究竟产生了怎样的错误呢</translation>
                <original>ではどのような間違いが生まれていってしまったんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="49" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:50,307</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:51,728</end-time>
                <translation>请看这边</translation>
                <original>こちらをご覧ください</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="50" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:53,464</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:57,260</end-time>
                <translation>亲鸾死后 与他的教义不同的解释
親鸞の死後その教えとは異なる解釈</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="51" hasRuby="0">
