            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="55" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:09,268</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:13,115</end-time>
                <translation>你是信阿弥陀佛的本愿在念佛
阿弥陀仏の本願を信じて念仏してるの</translation>
