            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="71" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:06,582</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:10,213</end-time>
                <translation>念佛灭罪：只要念佛 多重的罪都能消除</translation>
                <original>念仏すればどんなに重い罪だって消せるよ</original>
                <spell/>
