            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="72" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:10,213</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:12,296</end-time>
                <translation>来一起念佛</translation>
                <original>レッツ念仏</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="73" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:14,466</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:20,472</end-time>
                <translation>并不是念了佛 罪就会消失</translation>
                <original>念仏したからといって罪が消えるわけではありません</original>
