            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="74" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:22,366</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:27,930</end-time>
                <translation>即身成佛：我已经超越了烦恼 开悟了</translation>
                <original>俺煩悩を乗り越えてすでに悟りを開いたから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="75" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:27,930</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:29,700</end-time>
                <translation>什么都可以问我</translation>
                <original>何でも聞いて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="76" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:33,369</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:40,715</end-time>
                <translation>怀着烦恼生活的人无法在今世开悟</translation>
                <original>煩悩を抱えて生きる人がこの世で悟りを開くことはできません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="77" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:40,715</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:46,397</end-time>
                <translation>回心灭罪：做了坏事 每次都要忏悔并改过自新才行</translation>
                <original>悪い行いをしたらその度に懺悔して心を改めなければだめだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="78" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:49,159</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:52,771</end-time>
                <translation>犯了恶就必须改过自新</translation>
                <original>悪を犯したら心を改めなければならない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="79" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:52,771</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:55,455</end-time>
                <translation>这是自力的想法</translation>
                <original>というのは自力の考えです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="80" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:57,149</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:01,213</end-time>
                <translation>边地堕狱：真可怜 那家伙是自力</translation>
                <original>かわいそうにあいつ自力だから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="81" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:01,213</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:05,929</end-time>
                <translation>只能到净土的边缘 不久就会下地狱</translation>
                <original>浄土の端っこにしか行けないでそのうち地獄行きだわ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="82" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:08,770</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:13,979</end-time>
                <translation>自力修行的人也不会下地狱</translation>
                <original>自力で修行する人も地獄には落ちません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="83" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:13,979</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:16,544</end-time>
                <translation>施量别报：你布施大概能出多少？</translation>
                <original>お伏せいくらくらい出せます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="84" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:16,544</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:18,964</end-time>
                <translation>根据这个 去净土的时候</translation>
                <original>それによって浄土に行った時</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="85" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:18,964</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:22,532</end-time>
                <translation>能成为什么样的佛会有所不同</translation>
                <original>どういう仏になれるかっていうのが変わってくるんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="86" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:25,256</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:30,394</end-time>
                <translation>布施的多少并不会造成功德上的差别</translation>
                <original>お伏せも多い少ないで功徳に差がつくことはありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="87" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:30,394</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:32,841</end-time>
                <translation>这可不行啊</translation>
                <original>これダメだもう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="88" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:32,841</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:36,360</end-time>
                <translation>大家根本一点都不懂亲鸾圣人的教诲啊</translation>
                <original>みんな親鸞様の教えに何にも分かってねえじゃん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="89" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:36,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:38,444</end-time>
                <translation>我都气笑了</translation>
                <original>もう笑えてきた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="90" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:38,444</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:44,837</end-time>
                <translation>好 我来一个一个反驳</translation>
                <original>よしうまく一つ一つ潰していくよし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="91" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:44,837</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:48,782</end-time>
                <translation>能理解到它被以各种方式误解了</translation>
                <original>いろんな形で誤解をされてきたっていうのは何となく分かるんですけど</original>
