            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="92" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:48,782</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:50,796</end-time>
                <translation>是相信阿弥陀佛的本愿
阿弥陀仏の本願か</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="93" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:50,796</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:53,597</end-time>
                <translation>还是相信念佛的作用</translation>
                <original>念仏の働きのどちらを信じるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="94" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:53,597</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:56,201</end-time>
                <translation>不学习经典就无法往生</translation>
                <original>経典を学ばなければ往生できないよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="95" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:56,201</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:58,160</end-time>
                <translation>这些都是异义</translation>
                <original>こんな風に異義が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="96" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:58,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:02,013</end-time>
                <translation>是的 这个大致可以分为两类</translation>
                <original>そうですねこれですね大きく分けると2つなんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="97" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:04,617</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:07,579</end-time>
                <translation>即专修劝善和造恶无碍
専修勧善と造悪無碍という</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="98" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:07,579</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:10,406</end-time>
                <translation>也就是批判这两种立场</translation>
                <original>2つの立場を批判するということになります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="99" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:10,406</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:15,891</end-time>
                <translation>专修劝善是认为必须行善才能往生的立场</translation>
                <original>専修勧善の方は良いことをしなきゃ往生できないという立場</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="100" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:15,891</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:18,857</end-time>
                <translation>造恶无碍则是认为即使作恶</translation>
                <original>造悪無碍というのは悪を作っても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="101" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:18,857</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:22,481</end-time>
                <translation>也不会成为障碍 无论做什么都能往生的立场</translation>
                <original>妨げにならない何をしても往生できるという立場</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="102" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:22,481</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:25,340</end-time>
                <translation>两者都是在走极端</translation>
                <original>いずれも極端だということになるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="103" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:25,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:27,620</end-time>
                <translation>看这个异义一览表</translation>
                <original>この異義の一覧を見ますと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="104" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:27,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:33,687</end-time>
                <translation>第11、12、15、17条左右属于造恶无碍系</translation>
                <original>11、12、15、17あたりがこの造悪無碍系</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="105" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:33,687</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:40,159</end-time>
                <translation>第13、14、16、18条则被划分为专修劝善系</translation>
                <original>13、14、16、18が専修勧善系という風に分離されたりします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="106" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:40,159</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:43,907</end-time>
                <translation>以巧妙的平衡同时批判两者</translation>
                <original>上手いバランスで両方批判している</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="107" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:43,907</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:48,500</end-time>
                <translation>此处唯元的构思奇妙也是值得关注的地方</translation>
                <original>というこの優遠の構成力にも注目すべき点があると思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="108" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:48,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:50,121</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 在你看过的这些当中</translation>
