                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="109" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:50,121</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:53,220</end-time>
                <translation>哪一条作为错误最让你在意呢</translation>
                <original>どれが一番間違いとして気になるものがございましたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="110" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:53,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:55,943</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 对中途那个“精神鸭鸭”（搞笑组合）</translation>
                <original>えっとね途中でそれこそカモメンタルが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="111" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:55,943</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:58,073</end-time>
                <translation>演绎的很出色的那部分</translation>
                <original>上手にやってくれてたところなんだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="112" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:58,073</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:01,666</end-time>
                <translation>说到“做什么都可以哦”的时候</translation>
                <original>何やってもいいんだよねってなって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="113" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:01,666</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:03,243</end-time>
                <translation>我以为那个也会被判定为错误</translation>
                <original>それもブーが来ると思ったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="114" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:03,243</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:05,237</end-time>
                <translation>说“做坏事也可以哦 能成佛哦”</translation>
                <original>悪いことやっていいんだよね成仏できるんだよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="115" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:05,237</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:07,572</end-time>
                <translation>然后被说“不是那样的”那一条</translation>
                <original>って言ったらそんなことないって言ったやつが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="116" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:07,572</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:08,640</end-time>
                <translation>然后“bu”声就出来的那条</translation>
                <original>ブーだったやつどれかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="117" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:08,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:11,292</end-time>
                <translation>-是这个 第13条 -第13条啊</translation>
                <original>-これですね　第13条-13条ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="118" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:11,292</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:14,160</end-time>
                <translation>这是最让人思绪不定的一条</translation>
                <original>これが一番行ったり来たりさせられる条でして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="119" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:14,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:16,738</end-time>
                <translation>不畏惧恶的本愿骄慢</translation>
                <original>悪を恐れない本願ぼこり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="120" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:16,738</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:19,560</end-time>
                <translation>所谓“本愿骄慢”就是认为做什么都可以的立场</translation>
                <original>本願ぼこりっていうのは何をしてもOKという立場</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="121" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:19,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:24,040</end-time>
                <translation>“专修劝善”的人会批判说那样是不行的</translation>
                <original>それじゃダメだっていう批判を専修勧善サイドの人たちはしたと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="122" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:24,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:27,259</end-time>
                <translation>但这也是一种错误</translation>
                <original>それも間違いというようなですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="123" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:27,259</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:28,460</end-time>
                <translation>循环往复</translation>
                <original>ぐるぐるしたところに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="124" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:28,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:30,560</end-time>
                <translation>那么这究竟是怎么回事呢？一起看看吧</translation>
                <original>ではどんなことなのか見てみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="125" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:32,837</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:34,900</end-time>
                <translation>无论做了多么坏的事</translation>
                <original>どんなに悪いことしたって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="126" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:34,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:38,677</end-time>
                <translation>都能依靠阿弥陀佛的本愿往生</translation>
                <original>阿弥陀様の本願によって往生をできるんだし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="127" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:38,677</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:41,860</end-time>
                <translation>所以反而做坏事更好</translation>
                <original>だからむしろ悪いことした方がいいんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="128" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:44,424</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:47,460</end-time>
                <translation>针对这样的人</translation>
                <original>という人たちに対して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="129" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:47,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:50,949</end-time>
                <translation>这种本愿骄慢者绝对无法往生</translation>
                <original>そんな本願ぼこりは絶対に往生をできません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="130" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:50,949</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:54,145</end-time>
                <translation>出现了提倡这种教义的人</translation>
                <original>という教えを説く者が現れました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="131" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:54,145</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:57,421</end-time>
                <translation>但这是错误的</translation>
                <original>しかしこれは間違いです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="132" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:57,421</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:01,525</end-time>
                <translation>从前亲鸾上人曾对我说过这样的话</translation>
                <original>かつて親鸞上人は私にこんなことをおっしゃいました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="133" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:03,774</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:07,798</end-time>
                <translation>唯圆房 你相信我说的话吗</translation>
                <original>唯円房は私の言うことを信じるか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="134" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:07,798</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:10,442</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>その通りでございます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="135" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:10,442</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:15,020</end-time>
                <translation>那么 你绝不会违背我说的话吗</translation>
                <original>それでは私が言うことに決して損かないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="136" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:15,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:17,861</end-time>
                <translation>他再次这样郑重地询问</translation>
                <original>と重ねて王政になったので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="137" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:17,861</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:20,070</end-time>
                <translation>我会恭敬地接受</translation>
                <original>慎んでお受けいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="138" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:20,070</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:22,080</end-time>
                <translation>我这样回答道</translation>
                <original>と申し上げました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="139" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:22,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:28,712</end-time>
                <translation>于是上人说：那么你先去杀一千个人吧</translation>
                <original>すると上人はまず人を千人殺してくれないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="140" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:28,712</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:33,556</end-time>
                <translation>那样的话 你的往生就会确定无疑了</translation>
                <original>そうすればあなたの往生は確かなものになるだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="141" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:33,556</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:36,200</end-time>
                <translation>虽然是上人的命令</translation>
                <original>上人の王政ではありますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="142" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:36,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:37,760</end-time>
                <translation>但以我这样的器量</translation>
                <original>私のような器では</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="143" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:37,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:40,984</end-time>
                <translation>实在不认为自己能杀得了任何一个人</translation>
                <original>一人として殺すことなどできるとは思えません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="144" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:40,984</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:43,391</end-time>
                <translation>我这样回答之后</translation>
                <original>と申し上げたところ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="145" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:43,391</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:46,805</end-time>
                <translation>那么 你为什么说不会违背</translation>
                <original>それではどうしてこの親鸞の言うことに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="146" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:46,805</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:49,100</end-time>
                <translation>我亲鸾所说的话呢</translation>
                <original>背かないなどと言ったのだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="147" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:49,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:52,112</end-time>
                <translation>上人这样说道</translation>
                <original>と仰になりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="148" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:52,112</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:54,400</end-time>
                <translation>由此应该明白了吧</translation>
                <original>これでわかるであろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="149" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:54,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,000</end-time>
                <translation>如果什么事都能随心所欲的话</translation>
                <original>どんなことでも自分の思い通りになるのであれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="150" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:59,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:01,187</end-time>
                <translation>如果为了往生净土</translation>
                <original>浄土に往生をするために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="151" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:01,187</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:04,975</end-time>
                <translation>被命令去杀一千个人</translation>
                <original>千人の人を殺せと命じられれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="152" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:04,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:08,200</end-time>
                <translation>应该立刻就能杀掉</translation>
                <original>すぐに殺すことができるはずだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="153" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:08,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:13,520</end-time>
                <translation>但是你因为没有能够随心所欲杀人的因缘</translation>
                <original>けれども思い通りに殺すことのできる縁がないから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="154" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:13,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:16,537</end-time>
                <translation>所以才一个人也没有杀而已</translation>
                <original>一人も殺さないだけなのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="155" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:16,537</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:20,720</end-time>
                <translation>并不是因为自己心地善良才不杀人</translation>
                <original>自分の心が良いから殺さないわけではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="156" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:20,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:24,300</end-time>
                <translation>反过来 即使没有杀人的打算</translation>
                <original>また逆に殺すつもりがなくても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="157" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:24,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,466</end-time>
                <translation>也可能杀死一百人甚至一千人</translation>
                <original>百人あるいは千人の人を殺すこともあるだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="158" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:30,466</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:35,201</end-time>
                <translation>自己会做什么 一切都取决于过去的因缘</translation>
                <original>自分が何をするかはすべて過去の縁による</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="159" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:35,201</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:40,805</end-time>
                <translation>人就是这样 根据情况不同 不知道自己会做出什么事</translation>
                <original>状況次第では何をしてしまうかわからないのが人間なのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="160" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:40,805</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:44,987</end-time>
                <translation>阿弥陀佛悲悯这样的我们 想要拯救一切</translation>
                <original>そんな私たちを悲しんですべてを救おうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="161" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:44,987</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:48,340</end-time>
                <translation>明明已经立下了本愿</translation>
                <original>阿弥陀仏は本願を立てているのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="162" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:48,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:52,180</end-time>
                <translation>却认为不做好事就无法往生</translation>
                <original>良いことをしなければ往生をできないと考えるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="163" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:52,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:56,420</end-time>
                <translation>这不得不说是在怀疑阿弥陀佛的本愿</translation>
                <original>阿弥陀仏の本願を疑っていると言わざるを得ません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="164" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:56,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:59,300</end-time>
                <translation>但是 那故意作恶的人</translation>
                <original>でもじゃあわざと悪いことをしようって言ってる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="165" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:59,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:00,820</end-time>
                <translation>那样的人也可以吗</translation>
                <original>あいつはいいんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="166" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:00,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:02,820</end-time>
                <translation>并不是这个意思</translation>
                <original>そういうわけじゃない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="167" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:02,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:06,730</end-time>
                <translation>亲鸾上人说 不能因为有了药</translation>
                <original>親鸞上人はいくら薬があるからといって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="168" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:06,730</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:10,260</end-time>
                <translation>就喜欢去喝毒药</translation>
                <original>好き好んで毒を飲むものではないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="169" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:10,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:14,899</end-time>
                <translation>他说应该停止这种错误的想法</translation>
                <original>そういう誤った考えはやめるべきだと言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="170" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:14,899</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:16,280</end-time>
                <translation>但是</translation>
                <original>でも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="171" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:16,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:23,480</end-time>
                <translation>但是 作恶绝不会成为往生的障碍</translation>
                <original>でも決して悪を犯すことが往生の妨げにはなりません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="172" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:23,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:26,660</end-time>
                <translation>认为本愿骄慢不行的你</translation>
                <original>本願ぼこりはいけないって言うあなた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="173" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:26,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:30,980</end-time>
                <translation>那这个想法不也在夸耀本愿、依赖本愿吗</translation>
                <original>あなただって本願を誇り甘えているのでは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="174" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:30,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:33,523</end-time>
                <translation>什么样的恶叫作本愿骄慢</translation>
                <original>どのような悪を本願ぼこりと言い</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="175" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:33,523</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:37,745</end-time>
                <translation>什么样的恶又不叫作本愿骄慢呢</translation>
                <original>どのような悪を本願ぼこりではないというのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="176" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:37,745</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:40,586</end-time>
