歎異抄第十四条には</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="264" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:38,369</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:41,171</end-time>
                <translation>提出了念佛能否消除罪业</translation>
                <original>念仏によって罪が消せるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="265" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:41,171</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:45,551</end-time>
                <translation>这一问题</translation>
                <original>という問題が取り上げられています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="266" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:45,551</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:49,339</end-time>
                <translation>只要念佛 无论多重的罪都会消除</translation>
                <original>念仏すればどんなに重い罪だって消えるよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="267" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:49,339</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:51,700</end-time>
                <translation>所以一起来念佛</translation>
                <original>だからレッツ念仏</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="268" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:54,935</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:57,100</end-time>
                <translation>为什么这是错误的想法</translation>
                <original>これがなぜ誤った考えなのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="269" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:57,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:58,691</end-time>
                <translation>我来解说一下</translation>
                <original>解説しましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="270" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:00,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:03,386</end-time>
                <translation>确实有经文写道</translation>
                <original>確かに念仏を唱えれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="271" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:03,386</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:08,082</end-time>
                <translation>只要念佛 深重的罪业就会消除</translation>
                <original>深く重い罪が消えると書かれているお経があります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="272" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:08,082</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:13,015</end-time>
                <translation>但这被认为是为了让人知道</translation>
                <original>しかしこれは仏教で禁じられた罪や悪が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="273" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:13,015</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:19,525</end-time>
                <translation>佛教中禁止的罪与恶有多么深重</translation>
                <original>どれほど重いものであるかを知らせるために言っていると思われます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="274" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:19,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:23,905</end-time>
                <translation>相信每次念佛自己的罪业就会消失</translation>
                <original>念仏するたびに自分の罪が消え去ると信じるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="275" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:23,905</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:26,880</end-time>
                <translation>那正是靠自己的力量消除罪业</translation>
                <original>それこそ自分の力で罪を消し去って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="276" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:26,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:31,127</end-time>
                <translation>这无非是努力往生净土</translation>
                <original>浄土に往生しようと努めることに他なりません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="277" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:31,127</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:33,044</end-time>
                <translation>如果真是这样</translation>
                <original>もしそうだとすれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="278" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:33,044</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:36,138</end-time>
                <translation>一生之中心中所想</translation>
                <original>一生の間に心に思うことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="279" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:36,138</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:38,916</end-time>
                <translation>全都只会将自己</translation>
                <original>すべてみな自分を迷いの世界に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="280" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:38,916</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:41,465</end-time>
                <translation>束缚在迷惘的世界里</translation>
                <original>つなぎ止めるものでしかないのですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="281" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:41,465</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:45,805</end-time>
                <translation>直到生命尽头都不懈怠地持续念佛</translation>
                <original>命の尽きるまで怠ることなく念仏し続けて</original>
                <spell/>
