            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="291" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:20,727</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:25,140</end-time>
                <translation>相信净土的本愿绝不舍弃众生并托付于此</translation>
                <original>決して捨てないという浄土の本願を信じてお任せすれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="292" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:25,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:28,224</end-time>
                <translation>无论发生怎样意想不到的事</translation>
                <original>どのような思いがけないことがあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="293" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:28,224</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:33,512</end-time>
                <translation>即使造下深重罪业、未能念佛而结束生命</translation>
                <original>罪深い行いをし念仏することなく命が終わろうとも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="294" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:33,512</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:36,740</end-time>
                <translation>也能迅速往生净土</translation>
                <original>速やかに浄土に往生することができるのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="295" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:39,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,447</end-time>
                <translation>罪业不会消失</translation>
