            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="340" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:19:02,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:07,759</end-time>
                <translation>那么 亲鸾是如何谈论念佛的呢？</translation>
