            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="434" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:08,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,060</end-time>
                <translation>想要编造一些道理</translation>
                <original>何か理屈をこねようとして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="435" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:11,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:12,611</end-time>
                <translation>结果大家都被炎上了</translation>
                <original>みんな炎上していく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="436" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:12,611</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,920</end-time>
                <translation>这种心情我非常理解</translation>
                <original>気持ちすごいよく分かりますよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="437" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:13,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,040</end-time>
                <translation>总觉得自己的行为必须有道理</translation>
                <original>何か自分の行動には理屈がなきゃいけなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="438" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:17,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:18,900</end-time>
                <translation>必须用道理来说服别人</translation>
                <original>理屈で説得しないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="439" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:18,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,659</end-time>
                <translation>以为这样才能得到原谅</translation>
                <original>許してもらえないと思うのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="440" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:20,659</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:23,040</end-time>
                <translation>结果却因为那些道理而被炎上 不是吗</translation>
                <original>その理屈によって炎上していくじゃないですか</original>
